    "goal": "Co-incubate CYP3A4 with 4-methylumbelliferone at 1392.9 µM in the presence of a competitive inhibitor (Ki 209.7 µM) at 160.1 µM; report run-condition IC50, inhibited velocity and percent inhibition.",
    "rationale": "Competitive inhibition of CYP3A4-mediated 4-methylumbelliferone metabolism. Run-condition IC50 follows Cheng-Prusoff: IC50 = Ki(1+[S]/Km) = 209.7×(1+1392.9/754.0) = 597.09 µM. Fractional activity at the stated [I] is v_i/v_0 = [S]/(Km(1+[I]/Ki)+[S]) = 0.5116, so the inhibited velocity = 0.5116×Vmax = 1.5923 µmol/min and percent inhibition = 48.84%. [I]/[S] = 0.115 (competitive inhibitor well below substrate).",
